  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water and Sanitation Providers Association - Non Revenue Water Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WASPA organizes capacity building and information events for utilities and water stakeholders. WASPA convenes the WASPA conference to discuss identified topical themes affecting the water sector services performance. In 2026 the WASPA Conference theme is on Non Revenue Water. For the Embassy this is an important topic pertinent to support the Netherlands is giving utilities it is working with through current projects.  The NRW in Kenya is way above the  acceptable standards. As a result of the high NRW the water services sector also losses a commensurately high percentage of potential revenue, which it is in desparate need of.  NRW points to several inefficiencies in services provision that need to be systematically and structurally addressed through collective action. The conference is a call for action and brings together stakeholders across the water sector in Kenya and beyond to deliberate on this matter - share lessons, reflect on solutions and show case technological options.</narrative>
  </description>
